# Keyword counters and timestamps (CR 613.7c): "each counter receives a timestamp as it's put on an object. If that object
# already has a counter of that kind on it, each counter of that kind receives a new timestamp identical to that of the new
# counter."
# Qarsi Revenant's renew puts a flying, a deathtouch and a lifelink counter on Bot2's Cecil, Dark Knight. Then Abigale,
# Eloquent First-Year's trigger makes Cecil lose all abilities and puts a flying, a first strike and a lifelink counter on
# it. The loss takes the deathtouch of the earlier deathtouch counter (and the printed deathtouch); the flying and lifelink
# counters all have the new counters' later timestamp, so Cecil keeps flying and lifelink, and has first strike.
# On turn 4 Cecil attacks unblocked: Bot1 takes 2, Bot2 gains 2 and loses none to its lost Darkness ability.
# Turn 1: Swamp and the Mox Jets pay Qarsi; Bot2 Bolts it. Turn 3: Plains, the Swamp and Jets pay renew, Mox Pearl and the
# Plains Abigale.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Qarsi Revenant
Plains
Mox Pearl
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Cecil, Dark Knight
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Qarsi Revenant.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cecil, Dark Knight.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Qarsi Revenant)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Graveyard.Qarsi Revenant.Activate(Cecil, Dark Knight)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Keywords = Deathtouch; Flying; Lifelink
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Target(Cecil, Dark Knight)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Flying = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Deathtouch = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.Lifelink = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Counters.FirstStrike = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Cecil, Dark Knight > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot2.Life = 22
Bot2.Battlefield.Cecil, Dark Knight.Keywords = FirstStrike; Flying; Lifelink
